  <section class="container hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A SMALL STUDIO WITH BIG IDEAS</p><h1>Your next chapter.<br>A <span class="highlight">brighter</span> start.</h1><p class="intro">We turn your ideas into thoughtful websites and memorable brands. Simple, personal, and made to feel like you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Tell us your idea <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#work">Explore our work <span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="mini-spark" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span><span>For the dreamers, the makers,<br>and the businesses just getting started.</span></div></div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a website design for a fictional plant shop"><span class="art-spark" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span><div class="mock-window"><div class="window-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>Something good is growing.</small></div><div class="mock-body"><div class="mock-nav"><strong>little leaf.</strong><span>GROW WITH US &#8599;</span></div><div class="mock-content"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GREEN GOES A LONG WAY</p><h2>Room to grow.</h2><p>Bring a little life<br>into your everyday.</p><div class="mock-button">Find your green &#8594;</div></div><div class="plant-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="stem"></span><span class="leaf leaf-one"></span><span class="leaf leaf-two"></span><span class="leaf leaf-three"></span><span class="pot"></span></div></div></div><div class="floating-note"><span aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span> A fresh idea, brought to life.</div><span class="art-caption">GOOD DESIGN. A GOOD FEELING.</span></div>
