  <section class="container section" id="services">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE CAN HELP</p><h2>A little clarity.<br>A lot of possibility.</h2></div><p>Whether you're starting from scratch or ready for a refresh, let's make your next step feel easier.</p></div>
    <div class="service-grid"><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9638;</span><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Website design</h3><p>A welcoming home for your business. Clear pages, effortless navigation, and a beautiful experience on every screen.</p><a class="text-link" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Build your website &#8599;</a></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon peach" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Brand identity</h3><p>Colors, type, and a visual personality that tell your story before you say a word. Recognizable. Consistent. Yours.</p><a class="text-link" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Find your style &#8599;</a></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon lilac" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Website refresh</h3><p>Keep what works. Rethink what doesn't. Give your existing website a fresh look and a clearer sense of purpose.</p><a class="text-link" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Make a fresh start &#8599;</a></article></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work-section" id="work"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A GLIMPSE OF WHAT'S POSSIBLE</p><h2>Small brands.<br>Beautiful beginnings.</h2></div><p>Three fictional concepts, created to show the possibilities. Your business could be next.</p></div><div class="work-grid"><article class="work-card"><div class="work-art leaf-project"><span>little leaf.</span><strong>Good things<br>take root.</strong><span class="project-shape circle" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>Little Leaf</h3><p>Plant shop &middot; Website concept</p></div></article><article class="work-card"><div class="work-art coffee-project"><span>DAYBREAK / COFFEE</span><strong>A slower sip.<br>A better day.</strong><span class="project-shape cup" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>Daybreak Coffee</h3><p>Neighborhood cafe &middot; Brand concept</p></div></article><article class="work-card"><div class="work-art studio-project"><span>FORM &amp; FIELD</span><strong>Space for<br>something new.</strong><span class="project-shape arch" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="work-meta"><h3>Form &amp; Field</h3><p>Creative studio &middot; Website concept</p></div></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NO GUESSWORK, JUST GOOD COLLABORATION</p><h2>From hello to launch.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="about.jsp">Get to know us &#8599;</a></div><div class="process-grid"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>We listen.</h3><p>Your ideas, your goals, and what makes your business different.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>We create.</h3><p>Thoughtful design, with your feedback shaping every step.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>You grow.</h3><p>A fresh website and the confidence to share your next chapter.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="container cta-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR IDEA DESERVES A GOOD START</p><h2>Let's make something<br>worth sharing.</h2></div><a class="button button-light" href="contact.jsp#contact-form">Start a conversation &#8599;</a><span class="cta-spark" aria-hidden="true">&#10038;</span></section>
<section class="container story"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Good work starts<br>with listening.</h2></div><div><p>Before we talk about colors or code, we talk about you: your goals, your customers, and what your website needs to do.</p><p>Then we map a clear path from the first sketch to the finished experience, with feedback at every important step.</p><a class="text-link" href="services.jsp">Explore our services &#8594;</a></div></section>
<section class="container cta"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR IDEA DESERVES A START</p><h2>What could we create together?</h2><div class="actions" style="justify-content:center"><a class="button" href="work.jsp">Explore project concepts &#8599;</a><a class="text-link" href="pricing.jsp">View packages &#8594;</a></div></section>
